        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Kobe Bryant's pilot said he was climbing. Was he?",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.11,
        "window": 3.73,
        "fill": 0.834
      },
      {
        "scene": "climb",
        "text": "He climbed to get above the cloud, at 1,500 feet a minute, up to 2,400 feet.",
        "start": 4.03,
        "seconds": 6.38,
        "window": 7.03,
        "fill": 0.908
      },
      {
        "scene": "ear",
        "text": "So how could he not feel it? Turning moves fluid in tiny loops in your ear. In a steady turn, the fluid catches up.",
